---
kind: scene
id: hades.achilles.run12
title: A gift from Achilles
on: talk
target: npc.achilles
when: 'user.runs >= 10 && @knowsName'
priority: 50
once: user
state:
  user.runs: { type: number, default: 0 }
  user.patroclusNamed: { type: bool, default: false }
  run.giftTaken: { type: bool, default: false }
defs:
  knowsName: { type: bool, cel: "user.patroclusNamed" }
---

## The gift

@achilles: You've come back again, lad. Take this.
<branch id="gift">
  <choice id="accept" label="Take it">
    ::set{run.giftTaken = true}
    @achilles: Use it well.
  </choice>
  <choice id="refuse" label="Not now">
    @achilles: Suit yourself.
  </choice>
</branch>
